{
    "title": "Spelling Bee: Spelling Quiz",
    "description": "Words are everything how we express our emotions. Words are how we tell people how we feel. Beautiful words have the power to take your breath away and misspelt words are a big turn off. Spellings change the meaning of words. Words make us express our feelings, they become our part of expression. And misspellings often change the entire meaning of the expression. Can you guess the spelling of the fry and dolch sight words? How many times have you been asked to spell a word & you got confused and misspelled the word? This happens to the best of us. Even the easiest of the words sometimes may seem tricky. If you were looking for a fun and challenging way to improve your spelling, this is the correct game for you.\r\nWelcome to \u2018A spelling quiz: Spell it game\u2019. This is a multi-level spelling game with lots of common words we often misspell. With the constant use of english spelling quiz master app, you will see a boost in confidence in writing correct english words with perfect spellings. It might also help in improving your spoken english. You can quiz your spelling skill, learn the correct spelling by previewing the mistake and practice spellings of words with this Spell it app as many times as you want to.\r\n<b>LEARN WHILE YOU PLAY</b>\r\nDo you want to improve your spelling skills? Are you looking for a fun and engaging way to learn new words and practice your spelling? If so, then the English Spelling Quiz app is the perfect for you!\r\n\r\nThe English Spelling Quiz app is a comprehensive and user-friendly app that can help you improve your spelling skills at any level. The app features a wide range of quizzes, from beginner to advanced, so you can find the perfect level for your needs. Consider this as a spelling training app so that you can spell words well and improve english.\r\nEach quiz in the English Spell Quiz app contains a variety of challenging and engaging questions for your spelling practice. You can also try your hand at random quizzes to test your overall spelling skills.\r\nThe English Spelling Quiz app also provides you with detailed feedback on your performance. This feedback can help you identify your areas of weakness and focus your studies accordingly.\r\n<b>MULTI - LEVEL ENGLISH LEARNING APP</b>\r\n'Spelling bee Quiz' is a fun multi level advanced english spelling quiz\r\nspelling game app. You have to identify the correct spelling of 10 words to be able to qualify for the next level. Each level in this english spelling game is different from the previous one and has a completely different set of commonly misspelled words for you to guess.\r\n\r\n<b>PLAY SPELLING BEE ANYWHERE</b>\r\nPlay this spelling game anywhere anytime. it is available both online & offline, so the learning never stops! It is said, learning is the best when it is done in a fun way. Now, spend your time judiciously by playing this fun spelling master game. The english spelling word game is designed with sole objective of providing a platform where users can spend their time in learn correct english word spellings through a fun english quiz. \r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY THIS SPELLING QUIZ</b>\r\nIn this advanced english spelling quiz all you have to do is identify the correct spelling out of the four given options. To pass a level you will have to answer 10 correct spellings in english spelling game. Go for high-scores and become the Spelling bee!The app's user-friendly interface and intuitive design make it easy for anyone to play, whether you're a beginner or an experienced speller.\r\nAre you ready to put your spelling skills to the test? Look no further than the ultimate spelling quiz game! Whether you're a wordsmith or just looking for a fun way to improve your spelling, this app has something for everyone.  Download the ultimate spelling quiz game today and start improving your spelling skills in a fun and engaging way!",
